# Trivy configuration exceptions file
# Documented justifications for ignoring specific findings globally in this repository

# Ignore unrestricted egress rules globally in this development project
# Justification: K3s cluster nodes and HAProxy endpoints require public outbound access to download OS patches, tools, and resolve external DNS.
AVD-AWS-0104
AWS-0104

# The pinned upstream RabbitMQ Cluster Operator reconciles credentials,
# default-user and TLS Secrets for RabbitmqCluster resources. Removing this
# permission would break the operator; changes to the vendored RBAC are instead
# reviewed when the pinned operator version is upgraded.
KSV-0041
